      <div class="bento">
        <!-- 1. cowork pane (big, tinted) -->
        <article class="cell cell-cowork reveal" style="--i:0">
          <div class="mini-tree" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tr-folder">src <span class="tr-meta">api</span></div>
            <div class="tr-file">fetch.ts <span class="tr-badge">M</span></div>
            <div class="tr-file active">retry.ts <span class="ai-cursor">CODEZY</span></div>
            <div class="tr-file">parse.ts</div>
            <div class="tr-folder">tests <span class="tr-meta">2 files</span></div>
          </div>
          <h3>The workspace next to the conversation</h3>
          <p>Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>E</kbd>: browse the linked folder, open files beside the chat and watch the agent&rsquo;s cursor move as it writes.</p>
        </article>

        <!-- 2. safe edits (code) -->
        <article class="cell cell-diff reveal" style="--i:1">
          <div class="mini-diff" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="d-line del"><span class="d-g">&minus;</span>const data = await res.json()</div>
            <div class="d-line add"><span class="d-g">+</span>const data = await res.json()</div>
            <div class="d-line add"><span class="d-g">+</span>} catch (e) { retry(e) }</div>
            <div class="d-bar"><span>Accept hunk</span><span class="d-undo">/undo</span></div>
          </div>
          <h3>Every edit previewed, every edit backed up</h3>
          <p>Review the diff hunk by hunk, keep exactly what you want, and one <code>/undo</code> steps the whole batch back.</p>
        </article>

        <!-- 3. MCP -->
        <article class="cell cell-mcp reveal" style="--i:2">
          <div class="mini-chips" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="chip on">mcp__github__search_issues</span>
            <span class="chip">mcp__postgres__query</span>
            <span class="chip">mcp__files__read</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Bring your own tools</h3>
          <p>Add any stdio MCP server in Settings; its tools join the agent in build mode. One broken server never blocks a run.</p>
        </article>

        <!-- 4. history -->
        <article class="cell cell-history reveal" style="--i:3">
          <div class="mini-hist" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="h-row"><span class="h-time">14:02</span><span>3 files</span><span class="h-act">restore</span></div>
