          <p><code>/history</code> lists every safety copy taken before a write. Restore any point &mdash; confinement and a binary guard included.</p>
        </article>

        <!-- 5. memory + skills -->
        <article class="cell cell-memory reveal" style="--i:4">
          <div class="mini-chips" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="chip ok-chip"># tabs, not spaces</span>
            <span class="chip">/remember</span>
