        <div class="tabpanel" id="panel-plan" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-plan" tabindex="0">
          <div class="tab-copy">
            <h3>Advice only</h3>
            <p>The registry refuses mutating tools in plan mode. The agent reads, greps and reasons, then hands you a plan &mdash; nothing on disk changes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mini-suggest">
              <span class="ms-tag">suggestion</span>
              <code>wrap parse() in try/catch &rarr; src/parse.ts:12</code>
